# Check text files out with LF line endings on every OS, including Windows,
# where Git's default core.autocrlf=true would otherwise convert them to CRLF.
# Two things break under CRLF: tests/test_narrate.py pins the prompt file's
# sha256, which changes with the line endings, and verify_version_check.sh
# stops at `set -euo pipefail` ("invalid option name").
* text=auto eol=lf
